<title>MOLDOVA: SOCCER-MOLDOVA BEAT POLAND 3-1 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MOLDOVA BEAT POLAND 3-1 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>CHORZOW, Poland 1996-11-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moldova beat Poland 3-1</p>
<p>(halftime 1-1) in a European under-21 championship group 2</p>
<p>qualifier on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Poland - Dariusz Solnica 45</p>
<p>Moldova - Adrian Sosnovski 34, Viktor Komlionok 76,</p>
<p>Vladislav Robu 83.</p>
<p>Attendance: 2,441</p>
<p>Standings (tabulated - played, won, drawn, lost, goals for,</p>
<p>goals against, points):</p>
<p> Italy		  2  2  0  0  9  0  6</p>
<p> England		2  1  1  0  2  0  4</p>
<p> Moldova		3  1  0  2  3  6  3</p>
<p> Poland		 2  0  1  1  1  3  1</p>
<p> Georgia		1  0  0  1  0  6  0</p>
</text>
